rner of your dashboard and then click on the Settings menu",img:"/start/pos-6.png"},{title:"Turn on the USSD feature",desc:"Locate the USSD Feature option and switch it on to activate it.",img:"/start/pos-7.png"},{title:"You're done!",desc:"Enjoy easy offline banking. Transfer funds, top-up airtime and data, check your balance, reset your PIN, and block and unblock your account without an internet connection.",img:"/start/pos-8.png"}]},faqs:[{question:"What is CAC registration?",answer:"<p>CAC registration refers to the process of registering your business, company, or trustees with the Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC) in Nigeria. This registration provides legal recognition and numerous benefits for your business.</p>"},{question:"Why should I register my business with CAC?",answer:"<p>Registering your business with CAC offers legal benefits, enhances credibility, and helps you avoid liabilities. It also ensures your business is officially recognised, which can build trust with customers and partners.</p>"},{question:"What types of entities can I register through this service?",answer:"You can register your Trustee, Business, and Company name through our streamlined CAC registration process on the Moniepoint Business Banking app."},{question:"How can I register my business through the Business Banking dashboard?",answer:'You can easily register your business by accessing the Business Banking dashboard and following the step-by-step registration process. Simply click on the "Register your Business now!" button to get started.'}],subProduct:{title:"Guarantee your business credibility",desc:"Get started today! Enjoy the flexibility and reliability of registering your business on your business banking dashboard.",subs:[{title:"Business Name",desc:"This registration option is best for small businesses or partnerships and ensures that your business has its legal identity without the need for share capital or large-scale operations.\xa0",img:"/cac/cac-5.png",ctaLink:"/ng/cac-business-name-registration"},{title:"Companies",desc:"This option is ideal for registering your company with the Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC) as a public or private limited company.",img:"/cac/cac-6.png",comingSoon:!0},{title:"Incorporated Trustee",desc:"Legally incorporate your Trustees - non-profit organisation, charity, or religious institution - with the Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC).",img:"/cac/cac-7.png",comingSoon:!0}]},cta:{ctaTitle:"Join over 2 million businesses that trust Moniepoint.",ctaLink:c.mb,ctaText:"Open an Account"},script:r.v.pos};var l=i(4823),u=i.n(l);let p=e=>{let{data:s}=e;return(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:u()["hero-parent"],children:[(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:u().hero,children:[(0,t.jsx)("svg",{className:u()["hero-svg"],width:"1411",height:"729",viewBox:"0 0 1411 729",fill:"none",xmlns:"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg",children:(0,t.jsxs)("g",{opacity:"0.03",clipPath:"url(#clip0_1781_11349)",children:[(0,t.jsx)("path",{opacity:"0.2",d:"M904.124 771.049L903.618 771.341C871.174 789.946 845.612 795.755 838.69 794.221C831.492 792.721 812.592 774.463 793.911 742.106C775.23 709.748 768.85 684.22 771.168 677.267C773.269 670.524 791.176 651.236 823.446 632.478L823.953 632.185C856.396 613.581 881.958 607.771 888.88 609.305C896.078 610.806 915.033 629.159 933.659 661.421C952.285 693.683 958.72 719.306 956.403 726.259C954.356 733.097 936.512 752.349 904.124 771.049Z",stroke:"#0357EE",strokeWidth:"4"}),(0,t.jsx)("path",{opacity:"0.3",d:"M951.919 826.638L951.003 827.28C892.308 868.123 844.605 883.473 831.175 881.72C817.225 880.077 778.241 848.531 737.35 790.132C696.459 731.733 680.109 684.252 683.376 670.638C686.265 657.459 717.176 617.761 775.516 576.655L776.433 576.014C835.127 535.17 882.831 519.82 896.26 521.573C910.211 523.216 949.315 554.934 990.086 613.161C1030.86 671.389 1047.33 719.041 1044.06 732.655C1041.29 746.005 1010.49 785.623 951.919 826.638Z",stroke:"#0357EE",strokeWidth:"4"}),(0,t.jsx)("path",{opacity:"0.46",d:"M999.981 862